# .gitignore — Nuvia (Visual Studio / .NET / WPF / Inno Setup)

## Build output
bin/
obj/

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

## IDE
.idea/
*.swp
*~

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
!**/[Pp]ackages/repositories.config

## Publish & installer output
publish/
installer/Output/
*.exe
*.msi
*.msp

## Developer credential files
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.snk
*.cred
*.credential

## Runtime configuration (developer credentials — never commit)
config.json
**/config.json

## Session files
*.session
session.dat
*.session.dat

## SQLite databases
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

## Logs
logs/
*.log

## Local account data
AppData/
account.dat
*.account.dat

## OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## User-specific
*.rsuser
[Pp]ublish/
*.dotnetuser

## Inno Setup temp
[Setup]/tmp/

## Build/publish trees (CI rebuilds these; never commit binaries)
artifacts/
build/

## Brand exploration & tooling scratch, not part of the shipped app
logos/
logo-designer-skill/
.icon-preview/

## Editor/AI local state
.claude/
*.pdb

## Local edit backups (scratch, never published)
*.bak
*.bak_*